  "description": "CGEarthEye is a high-resolution remote sensing vision foundation model designed for the Jilin-1 satellite constellation. It features five ViT-based backbones with a total of 2.1 billion parameters, pre-trained on the JLSSD dataset (15 million sub-meter images with global and multi-seasonal coverage), and achieves state-of-the-art performance across 10 benchmarks for scene classification, object detection, semantic segmentation, and change detection.",
